# Fixture WIT deps are materialized at build time by `wash build` — its
# `wit fetch` resolves the local file refs in each fixture's wkg.toml (see
# `cargo xtask build-fixtures` in /xtask); the handful of fixtures whose world
# needs two versions of one package are staged by xtask instead, from the same
# shared source. The p2-wit-deps/ and p3-wit-deps/ dirs (and the bespoke
# wasmcloud-bridge/ contract) are not matched by this pattern because they have
# no `wit/` subtree.
*/wit/deps/

# Lock files written by the fetch
*/wkg.lock

# Build artifacts
*/target/
target/
